  "tha-ap505:1.1": "jotantaṃ ",
  "tha-ap505:1.2": "nisinnaṃ pabbatantare / ",
  "tha-ap505:1.3": "addasaṃ virajaṃ Buddhaṃ ",
  "tha-ap505:1.4": "lokajeṭṭhaṃ narāsabhaṃ. // // ",
  "tha-ap505:2.1": "*Pasannacitto sumano ",
  "tha-ap505:2.2": "sire* katvāna añjaliṃ / ",
  "tha-ap505:2.3": "kāsumārikam ādāya ",
  "tha-ap505:2.4": "Buddhaseṭṭhass' adas' ahaṃ. // // ",
  "tha-ap505:3.1": "Ekatiṃse ito kappe ",
  "tha-ap505:3.2": "yaṃ phalaṃ adadiṃ tadā / ",
  "tha-ap505:3.3": "duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi ",
  "tha-ap505:3.4": "phaladānass' idaṃ phalaṃ. // // ",
  "tha-ap505:4.1": "Kilesā . . . ",
  "tha-ap505:4.2": "pe . . . ",
  "tha-ap505:4.3": "",
  "tha-ap505:5.1": "",
  "tha-ap505:5.2": "pe . . . ",
  "tha-ap505:5.3": "pe . . . // // Sāgataṃ . . . pe . . . pe . . . pe . . . // // ",
  "tha-ap505:6.1": "Paṭisambhidā . . . ",
  "tha-ap505:6.2": "pe . . . ",
  "tha-ap505:6.3": "pe . . . pe . . . // // ",
  "tha-ap505:7.1": "Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā Kāsumāraphaladāyako thero i. g. a-ti. Kāsumāraphaladāyakattherassa apadānaṃ samattaṃ. ",
